      "caption": "Expand with the area model",
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "id": "s1",
      "narration": "Expand x plus two times x plus three with an area model. The tiles land as x squared, three x, two x and six ones. Collect the x tiles: x squared plus five x plus six. Every term in one bracket multiplied every term in the other.",
